<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-2xl text-primary mb-4">Targeted Treatment</h3>
<p class="text-on-surface-variant mb-6">Treatment varies by cause. Dental abscesses require source elimination (extraction or root canal). Mucoceles and ranulas require surgical excision. Space infections require IV antibiotics and drainage. Persistent or enlarging swellings require biopsy to rule out neoplastic changes.</p>
