<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Incision and Drainage</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">For fluctuant intraoral abscesses — drainage inside the mouth at CARE Hospitals operating rooms, providing immediate pain relief.</p></li>
