<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-primary">Surgical Treatment</h3>
</div>
<ul class="space-y-6">
<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Mucocele / Ranula Excision</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Complete surgical removal of the affected salivary gland to prevent recurrence. <a href="swollen-cheek-treatment-hyderabad.php" class="text-secondary underline">Swollen cheek</a> page covers salivary gland care.</p></li>
<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Tooth Extraction or Root Canal</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Dental-origin intraoral swelling requires definitive treatment of the source tooth. <a href="dental-abscess-treatment-hyderabad.php" class="text-secondary underline">Dental abscess treatment</a> has full details.</p></li>
<li><h4 class="font-semibold text-primary mb-2">Biopsy and Histopathology</h4><p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Persistent or enlarging intraoral swellings with no clear dental cause require biopsy to rule out premalignant or malignant changes.</p></li>
